<title>DENMARK: Landwirtschaftliche Rentenbank raises bond amount.</title>
<headline>Landwirtschaftliche Rentenbank raises bond amount.</headline>
<dateline>COPENHAGEN 1997-01-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Germany's Landwirtschaftliche Rentenbank raised an existing 460 million crown ($73.7 million), four percent bond offer due 2003 to 510 million crowns, said a statement distributed by Copenhagen Stock Exchange on Monday by lead manager Dresdner Bank. --Chris Follett, Copenhagen newsroom +45 33969650 ($ = 6.24 Danish Crowns)</p>
</text>
